# LKH TSP solver scratch. fast_exploration_manager.cpp:68,817 rewrites
# single.par/.tsp with ofstream on every solve and reads single.txt back
# (:849,:852), so these are per-run output, not source. test.par/.tsp/.txt
# stay tracked, which also keeps the resource/ directory in a fresh clone.
single.par
single.tsp
single.txt

# exploration_manager/config/replay/ — parameter profiles that run_replay.sh
# regenerates from a bag's /epic/session_info on every replay. Kept on disk as
# the record of what a replay ran with, but derived data, and deliberately NOT
# beside real*.yaml so a replay can never disturb a flight config.
# Leading **/ is required: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to this
# .gitignore's directory, and the real path is nested under
# src/EPIC_poongsan/src/EPIC/src/global_planner/.
**/exploration_manager/config/replay/

# minco_planner/config/traj.rviz — rviz rewrites its config on exit, so this
# churned ~100 lines per run. No launch file references it (the traj.rviz in
# the launch files is test_interface's, a different file).
traj.rviz
